            "id": 145492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka jest maksymalna liczba wierszy, które może mieć blok kodu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Jeden</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145493,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Door unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Door unlocked</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic, kod nie uruchamia się, ponieważ <code>hasKey</code> nie jest wartością logiczną</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Door unlocked</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145494,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nic, ponieważ kod znajdujący się między nawiasami klamrowymi zostaje pominięty</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game paused</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nic, ponieważ kod znajdujący się między nawiasami klamrowymi zostaje pominięty.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145495,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj instrukcję display między nawiasami klamrowymi, aby utworzyć blok kodu instrukcji if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level complete!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>{</code>, następnie <code>console.log</code>, a potem <code>\"Level complete!\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145496,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj drugi fragment kodu, aby rozbudować blok kodu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New quest started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>console.log</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>\"Collect 3 coins\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145497,
